						"description": "💬 Ask about vendor and total amount from your document.\n\n**How to use:**\n1. First upload a document using the upload endpoint\n2. Copy the document ID from the response\n3. Replace {{document_id}} with the actual ID\n4. Send this request to get vendor and total information"
